                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.5151/263: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-31T16:00:00-03:00">December 31, 1933—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 31—3:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>131. My 126, December 21, 7 p.m. Figueiredo has presented his resignation.
                    Department may consider it desirable to suggest Kent withhold action long enough
                    to see whether developments render drastic measures superfluous.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
